flowchart LR
  A[Parse provider stream] --> B[guardEvents + transforms]
  B --> C{tool_call.done?}
  C -->|no| D[Forward text / reasoning]
  C -->|yes| E{Policy OK?}
  E -->|block/warn violation| F[error + finish policy_violation]
  E -->|audit violation| G[onViolation log + pass event]
  E -->|clean| H[executeTool]
  G --> I[App decides execute]
